{"questionId":"u14-s007-v010","unitId":"u14","numericUnitId":14,"topicId":"u14-sequences","skillId":"sequence-pattern-word","difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_MATH_108","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementPolicy":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_INTEGRATION","text":"活動場地第 1 區掛 9 面旗，之後每一區比前一區多 5 面。第 18 區掛幾面旗？","givenConditions":["第1區9面","每區多5面"],"target":"第18區旗數","choices":["89","99","104","94"],"answerIndex":3,"independentSolution":"旗數T_n=9+5(n-1)=5n+4，代n=18得94。","mainExplanation":"旗數T_n=9+5(n-1)=5n+4，代n=18得94。","steps":["辨認區號為項次。","計算17次增加。","依此可確定答案為「94」。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"89","truth":false,"reason":"89是只增加16次。"},{"choice":"99","truth":false,"reason":"99是增加18次。"},{"choice":"104","truth":false,"reason":"104多增加2次。"},{"choice":"94","truth":true,"reason":"9+17×5=94面。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"把18區當成18次新增。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["arithmetic-mean-term"],"prerequisiteCheck":"使用前置技能「等差中項」所建立的概念。","estimatedTimeSec":90,"unitCheck":"題目為純數時無外部單位；若含情境，所有量均使用題幹同一單位並已在答案保留。","roundingCheck":"所有計算使用精確整數、分數或有限小數；題目未要求四捨五入。","ambiguityBoundaryAudit":"答案為第18區單區94面，不是前18區合計。","difficultyReason":"素養：區號、每區旗數與「比前區多」共同構成離散配置模型。","literacyContextNecessity":"活動場地情境提供每區單次數量而非累積旗數的必要辨識。","authoringIntent":"從場地配置描述列式求遠區。","figureDrawingSpecRef":null,"reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"b39852404b2e9efb97e93fea9a228e808f1132af9fb7f1fdcfa1803a56233a62"}
{"questionId":"u14-s007-v011","unitId":"u14","numericUnitId":14,"topicId":"u14-sequences","skillId":"sequence-pattern-word","difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_MATH_108","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementPolicy":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_INTEGRATION","text":"停車場第 k 區有 12+3(k-1) 個車位。第 15 區有幾個車位？","givenConditions":["第k區公式"],"target":"第15區車位數","choices":["51","57","54","180"],"answerIndex":2,"independentSolution":"k=15時，12+3(15-1)=12+42=54個。","mainExplanation":"k=15時，12+3(15-1)=12+42=54個。","steps":["代入k=15。","處理括號k-1。","依此可確定答案為「54」。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"51","truth":false,"reason":"51是只增加13次。"},{"choice":"57","truth":false,"reason":"57是增加15次。"},{"choice":"54","truth":true,"reason":"12+3×14=54。"},{"choice":"180","truth":false,"reason":"180是12×15，忽略公式。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"把k直接當增加次數。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["arithmetic-mean-term"],"prerequisiteCheck":"使用前置技能「等差中項」所建立的概念。","estimatedTimeSec":90,"unitCheck":"題目為純數時無外部單位；若含情境，所有量均使用題幹同一單位並已在答案保留。","roundingCheck":"所有計算使用精確整數、分數或有限小數；題目未要求四捨五入。","ambiguityBoundaryAudit":"k為正整數；只求單區。","difficultyReason":"素養：需理解k是區號，公式輸出為該區車位數。","literacyContextNecessity":"停車區情境讓變數與實際編號、車位單位相連。","authoringIntent":"解讀已給的情境公式。","figureDrawingSpecRef":null,"reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"681a268b6b5444e26b4d0c16850a8a76c7340af991bd19cbfe363b622eb9fa86"}
{"questionId":"u14-s007-v012","unitId":"u14","numericUnitId":14,"topicId":"u14-sequences","skillId":"sequence-pattern-word","difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_MATH_108","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementPolicy":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_INTEGRATION","text":"某學習平台第 n 級徽章需要 n²+n 個圖示。第 20 級需要多少個圖示？","givenConditions":["第n級需n²+n個"],"target":"第20級圖示數","choices":["400","420","421","440"],"answerIndex":1,"independentSolution":"公式T_n=n(n+1)，T_20=20×21=420個。","mainExplanation":"公式T_n=n(n+1)，T_20=20×21=420個。","steps":["因式化或直接代入。","附圖示單位。","依此可確定答案為「420」。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"400","truth":false,"reason":"400漏加n。"},{"choice":"420","truth":true,"reason":"20²+20=400+20=420。"},{"choice":"421","truth":false,"reason":"421多加1。"},{"choice":"440","truth":false,"reason":"440把第二項誤作2n。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"只看到平方核心而漏掉額外一列n。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["arithmetic-mean-term"],"prerequisiteCheck":"使用前置技能「等差中項」所建立的概念。","estimatedTimeSec":90,"unitCheck":"題目為純數時無外部單位；若含情境，所有量均使用題幹同一單位並已在答案保留。","roundingCheck":"所有計算使用精確整數、分數或有限小數；題目未要求四捨五入。","ambiguityBoundaryAudit":"n=20正整數；圖示數420個。","difficultyReason":"素養：徽章等級是輸入，圖示數是由二維結構產生的輸出。","literacyContextNecessity":"平台徽章情境提供離散等級與整數圖示限制，答案不可近似。","authoringIntent":"由平方加線性規則求大階段。","figureDrawingSpecRef":null,"reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"70100b45b0fde987c7ad256955bb8f69a5640a305365d65313391cc900f91e15"}
